---
import InnerPage from '../layouts/InnerPage.astro';
import { BOOK_CALL_URL } from '../config/site';
---

<InnerPage
	title="About"
	description="TeleTrex builds fast, friendly AI for startups and small businesses—practical systems, not science projects."
>
	<h1>About TeleTrex</h1>
	<p class="page-lead">
		We’re an AI agency for teams that care about <strong>margin, momentum, and sanity</strong>. If you’re
		tired of growth costing a linear jump in headcount—or of losing deals to slow follow-up—we’re built
		for you.
	</p>

	<p class="prose-block">
		Our bias is toward <strong>plain language and shipped work</strong>. We start from the business pain
		(what’s breaking, what’s expensive, what customers keep asking) and design assistants and workflows
		your people will actually adopt.
	</p>

	<p class="prose-block">
		You don’t need a technical background to work with us. You need a clear picture of what “better”
		looks like—we’ll handle the rest alongside you, with guardrails and room to escalate to humans when
		it matters.
	</p>

	<h2 class="section-title">What we believe</h2>
	<ul class="prose-block bullets">
		<li>Speed and tone matter as much as the model under the hood</li>
		<li>AI should reduce repetitive work—not add a new maze to manage</li>
		<li>If it doesn’t move a real metric (time, revenue, satisfaction), it’s not done</li>
	</ul>

	<p class="prose-block about-cta">
		<a class="btn btn--primary" href={BOOK_CALL_URL}>Book a call</a>
	</p>
</InnerPage>

<style>
	.bullets {
		padding-left: 1.25rem;
	}

	.bullets li {
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.about-cta {
		margin-top: 2rem;
	}
</style>
